{"synopsis":"Yeon Woo-hyuk adalah pemain setia game misteri yang berlatar dunia bela diri. Suatu hari, dia terbangun di dalam game tersebut sebagai seorang pejabat rendah. Dia mengingat semua kasus penting dari game itu dan mulai memecahkan kejahatan untuk bertahan hidup. Namun, kemampuan khususnya, “Spirit Eye”, ternyata merupakan gejala aneh dari tubuhnya yang terbuka secara paksa. Sekarang, dia bukan hanya seorang pegawai yang menangani kasus, tapi juga seorang yang harus belajar bela diri untuk bertahan hidup di dunia Murim yang mematikan. Bisakah seorang pegawai sipil bertahan di dunia yang berbahaya ini?","alternative_title":"무림 속 공무원으로 살아가는 법","author":"Pengseu, Writing Machine","artist":"KZV","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"2bb39b7f-824a-4976-9cbc-84810a59b86e","number":"69","chapter":"69","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8670332c-a7b6-4673-94b8-295159de2a39/chapter_ch_69/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"661e7233-0d30-422b-b149-cd8eb5f4423a","number":"68","chapter":"68","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":["